    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋakipi ŋuna aleleunito alo Kai ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol ekenyaku ayoŋ lopuke ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj, abu ayoŋ eŋolik a nen ŋakipi ŋuna aleleete alokwap epuke ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj; aleleete ŋakipi ŋun lowae ŋolo alo Kide (anerae eŋoliyarit Akai ka Akuj lowae ŋolo alo Kide); aleleete ŋakipi ŋun alokwap epuke ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap, etorito diyete namuroet alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okolomunia ayoŋ kiŋa, kitoroi lopuke ŋolo alo Kuju, ekesirimo ayoŋ akibois ŋin alokiŋa tari lopuke ŋolo alo Kide alapatu, abu ayoŋ eŋolik a nen ŋakipi eleleunito alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol torotok a nen etiŋit akipimet, tolot lowae ŋolo alo Kide, kipimu ŋimitae ŋamiae ŋakan aneni aya ŋakipi, ido okoriko ayoŋ eketoryo nakipi, adolito ŋakipi ŋun lotobolae kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nabo iŋes kipimu ŋimitae ŋice ŋamiae ŋakan aneni aya ŋakipi, ido okoriko ayoŋ eketoryo nakipi, adolito ŋakipi ŋun nakuŋin kaŋ. Abu nabo ekile ŋol kipimu ŋimitae ŋice ŋamiae ŋakan aneni aya ŋakipi, ido okoriko ayoŋ eketoryo nakipi, adolito ŋakipi ŋun nacir kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nabo kipimu ŋimitae ŋice ŋamiae ŋakan, abu nen toruwor aŋolol ŋina pa apedorit ayoŋ adokar ekekwaye, anerae apotu ŋakipi kikeun kidiama, arae ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akilum bon iŋes apedorit adokar ekekwaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol ekeŋit ayoŋ tema, “Lokoku a ituŋanan, ite iyoŋ aŋolol na a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai iŋes okoyau ayoŋ lokipetot a aŋolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani adoli ayoŋ lokipetot, abu eŋolik ŋikito ŋulu alalak nooi eyakasi ŋolokipetot ka a ŋolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema ekile ŋol neni kaŋ, “Eleleete ŋakipi nu nakwap ŋina eyai lowae ŋolo alo Kide, ido totiyaaros Araba. Ani elomarete nanam ŋina ewuatar ŋakipi, toruwor ŋakipi ŋuna ajokak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni daadaŋ eleleyari aŋolol ŋin, eyarete ŋisubuna daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋakipi, eyakaun nakipi ŋun ŋikolya ŋulu alalak nooi, anerae neni daadaŋ elomarete ŋakipi ŋun ananam, eruwor ŋakipi a nen ŋuna ajokak; eyari ibore daadaŋ aneni eleleiyari aŋolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erubakinete ŋituŋa ewuaasi a nen ikamete ŋikolya alodiyete anam ageun alocowa a ŋolo a Gedi tari locowa ŋolo a Egilaim. Eruwor nen akibois ŋina epetanakinio ŋatibae tooko, eyakaun nen ŋikolya ŋulu alalak ŋulu egelegelya ŋikabilae, ikwaanikin ŋikolya a nen ka ŋulu anam Mediteranian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋakipi ŋuna eyakasi lojiomya ŋulu eyakasi diyete anam ŋin ka nataparin ŋuna eyakasi diyete anam ŋin, imyekinio ŋakipi kec erae acumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elomunete alokipetotyo a ŋuluarei, a ŋulu ka a ŋolol ŋikito ŋulu a ŋikabilae a daadaŋ ŋulu enyamyo ŋaraito kec. Nyeiniyarete ŋakwii a ŋikito a ŋul, kori nyeraraun kwap ŋaraito kec, nai erayete ikes ŋaraito ŋuna ajokak a ŋololap, anerae eleleunito ŋakipi neni kec anakibois a ŋina asegan. Eruwor ŋaraito kec akimuj ka eruwor ŋakwii kec ekitoe ŋolo ikitaŋaleuni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikukorin a akwap ŋulukitet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar, erae lu ŋikukorin ŋulu ityakatyakaata iyes akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina a ŋikabilae a Isirael a ŋulutomon ka ŋiarei. Emaikina ekabila a Yosepu toryamu ŋakiboisyo ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes totyakatyakata akwap eriyan, abu ayoŋ ekoŋ ainakin akwap na neni atapapaa kus, eruwor akwap na ŋina kus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor lo ekukoru a akwap kus: Alowae a ŋolo alo Kuju, isyakini ananam Mediteranian, kitor Esilon, tomyaa Leboamas kiropo Sedad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Berosa, Sibiraim (akwap ŋina eyai kidiŋ akwap a Damasko ka akwap ŋina ka Amas), tomyaa tari Aseratikon, lotaun ŋolo eyai lokukoru ŋolo ka Auran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, isyakini ekukoru ŋolo alo Kuju ananam Mediteranian, tomyaa lowae ŋolo alo Kide lotaun Asarenon ŋolo eyai Kuju ekukoru a Damasko, toyai Amas Kuju ekukoru kus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alowae a ŋolo alo Kide, isyakini ekukoru kus alokidiŋ Auran ka Damasko, tomek aŋolol Yorodan, kitor kidiŋ Gilead ka akwap a Isirael tomyaa nanam ŋina Atwan kisalak Tamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap, isyakini ekukoru kus alo Tamar, tomyaa tari locowae ŋulu a Meribas-Kades, tomek a nen ayonae ŋina a Ijipit, toloma nanam Mediteranian.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alowae a ŋolo alo To, eruwor anam Mediteranian iŋes eruwor ekukoru, tomyaa Kuju nakibois ŋina ka Leboamas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, ikorakinete iyes akwap na neni kus a ŋikabilae a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
