        },
        {
          "text": "Iryamunete iyes iŋes erae ŋina aruwor ŋina kus jik. Emaikina ŋituŋa ŋulugelae ŋulu iboiyete ka iyes, ŋulu adaut auruun ŋidwe a ne toryamut neni eruwor neni kec apaki ŋina ikoryata iyes akwap. Emaikina ikes yae erae ŋituŋa ŋulu ka akwap a Isirael. Emaikina ikes kilamilama kaapei ka iyes apaki ŋina ekorere akwap neni a ŋikabilae a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
