        {
          "text": "Igelaanot daadaŋ ŋini iboiyete ka iyes, eryamuni akibois keŋ kaapei ka ŋituŋa a ekabila a ŋolo iboiyoto iŋes. Ayoŋ Ekapolon Akuj alimu ŋun.",
